@y(24)@t(3)Then suddenly, you lose all sense of your surroundings @w(60)
until even the notion of time itself becomes unclear. @w(60)
While in a daze, you think you hear a distant voice.@/t

@y(24)@t(3)This tower @w(30)stretches through the heavens 
@w(20)parting the clouds @w(30)and yet seems
to have no summit in sight as if it fades
only into oblivion. @w(20)
Up@w(20) and up@w(20) it continues...@/t

@y(24)@t(3)Ah, @w(20)this is it. This is how you wish things to be! @w(60)
With a daring grin on your face, @w(20)you give thanks to the goddesses @w(30)
for new adventures await,@w(20) and you are eager to again set forth.@/t

@y(24)@t(3)You think for a moment @w(10)pondering what you should wish for.
@w(20) Then you find yourself dumbfounded, @w(120)
for there is but one answer you can think of. @w(120)
Trying to withold yourself from laughter, you reply...@w(120)@/t

@c(18)Resurrecting@/c

When your HP drops to 0 and you cannot fight any longer,
you will recover automatically use one ##(COLOR_LP) to revive.

@c(18)Temporary weapons for allies@/c

You can disarm your allies of their temporary
weapons by ##(COLOR_CLICK)ing on them.

@c(18)Mounts for allies@/c

You can force your allies to dismount by
##(COLOR_CLICK)ing on them.

@c(18)##(C_QUEST)@/c

You can accept ##(COLOR_C_QUEST)@c(13)s@/c from the guild here.
Completing ##(COLOR_C_QUEST)@c(13)s@/c will earn you valuable rewards.

@c(18)The spoils screen@/c

You can appraise unknown items that you claimed from treasure chests.
You can also sell your unwanted spoils.
